#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/admin/server-configuration.rst:4
msgid ""
"This Server Configuration Guide is organized into sections to provide you"
" with the tools and knowledge necessary to configure your Mattermost "
"server for improved efficiency, scalability, and functionality."
msgstr ""
"이 서버 구성 가이드는 OKR.BEST 서버의 효율성, 확장성, 기능을 개선하도록 구성하는 데 필요한 "
"도구와 지식을 제공하는 섹션으로 구성되어 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/admin/server-configuration.rst:6
msgid ""
"Whether you’re setting up email notifications, optimizing search "
"capabilities, enabling high availability, or configuring telemetry, this "
"guide covers all aspects of server setup and management. Use the "
"navigation below to access detailed instructions for each topic."
msgstr ""
"이메일 알림 설정, 검색 기능 최적화, 고가용성 활성화, 텔레메트리 구성 등 서버 설정 및 관리의 "
"모든 측면을 이 가이드에서 다룹니다. 아래 탐색을 사용해 각 주제의 자세한 지침에 접근하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/admin/server-configuration.rst:30
msgid ""
":doc:`Store configuration in your database </administration-"
"guide/configure/configuration-in-your-database>` - Learn how to store "
"configuration information in your Mattermost database rather than as a "
"JSON file."
msgstr ""
":doc:`데이터베이스에 구성 저장 </administration-guide/configure/configuration-in-your-database>` - 구성 정보를 "
"JSON 파일이 아닌 OKR.BEST 데이터베이스에 저장하는 방법을 알아봅니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/admin/server-configuration.rst:31
msgid ""
":doc:`Server configuration options </administration-guide/configure"
"/configuration-settings>` - Learn about server configuration options for "
"Mattermost."
msgstr ""
":doc:`서버 구성 옵션 </administration-guide/configure/configuration-settings>` - OKR.BEST의 서버 구성 옵션에 "
"대해 알아봅니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/admin/server-configuration.rst:32
msgid ""
":doc:`Set up attribute-based access controls </administration-"
"guide/manage/admin/attribute-based-access-control>` - Learn how to set up"
" attribute-based access controls for your Mattermost instance for Zero "
"Trust Security."
msgstr ""
":doc:`속성 기반 액세스 제어 설정 </administration-guide/manage/admin/attribute-based-access-control>` - "
"제로 트러스트 보안을 위해 OKR.BEST 인스턴스에 속성 기반 액세스 제어를 설정하는 방법을 알아봅니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/admin/server-configuration.rst:33
msgid ""
":doc:`Set up Mattermost Agents</administration-guide/configure/agents-"
"admin-guide>` - Learn how to enable AI-powered Agents for your Mattermost"
" instance."
msgstr ""
":doc:`OKR.BEST Agents 설정</administration-guide/configure/agents-admin-guide>` - OKR.BEST 인스턴스에서 "
"AI 기반 Agents를 활성화하는 방법을 알아봅니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/admin/server-configuration.rst:34
msgid ""
":doc:`Set up auto-translation </administration-"
"guide/manage/admin/autotranslation>` - Learn how to enable and configure "
"automatic message translation for your Mattermost instance."
msgstr ""
":doc:`자동 번역 설정 </administration-guide/manage/admin/autotranslation>` - OKR.BEST 인스턴스에서 자동 "
"메시지 번역을 활성화하고 구성하는 방법을 알아봅니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/admin/server-configuration.rst:35
msgid ""
":doc:`Install Mattermost Boards </administration-guide/configure/install-"
"boards>` - Learn how to install and configure the Boards plugin for your "
"Mattermost instance."
msgstr ""
":doc:`OKR.BEST Boards 설치 </administration-guide/configure/install-boards>` - OKR.BEST 인스턴스에 "
"Boards 플러그인을 설치하고 구성하는 방법을 알아봅니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/admin/server-configuration.rst:36
msgid ""
":doc:`Manage custom user attributes </administration-guide/manage/admin"
"/user-attributes>` - Learn how to manage custom user attributes in user "
"profiles in Mattermost."
msgstr ""
":doc:`사용자 지정 사용자 속성 관리 </administration-guide/manage/admin/user-attributes>` - OKR.BEST의 사용자 "
"프로필에서 사용자 지정 사용자 속성을 관리하는 방법을 알아봅니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/admin/server-configuration.rst:37
msgid ""
":doc:`Environment variables </administration-guide/configure/environment-"
"variables>` - Learn how to use environment variables for Mattermost "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
":doc:`환경 변수 </administration-guide/configure/environment-variables>` - OKR.BEST 구성에 환경 변수를 사용하는 "
"방법을 알아봅니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/admin/server-configuration.rst:38
msgid ""
":doc:`Customize the server </administration-guide/manage/admin/customize-"
"branding>` - Learn about customizing branding for Mattermost server."
msgstr ""
":doc:`서버 사용자 지정 </administration-guide/manage/admin/customize-branding>` - OKR.BEST 서버의 브랜딩 "
"사용자 지정에 대해 알아봅니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/admin/server-configuration.rst:39
msgid ""
":doc:`SMTP email setup </administration-guide/configure/smtp-email>` - "
"Learn how to set up SMTP email for Mattermost."
msgstr ""
":doc:`SMTP 이메일 설정 </administration-guide/configure/smtp-email>` - OKR.BEST용 SMTP 이메일을 설정하는 방법을 "
"알아봅니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/admin/server-configuration.rst:40
msgid ""
":doc:`Email templates </administration-guide/configure/email-templates>` "
"- Learn about customizing email templates for Mattermost."
msgstr ""
":doc:`이메일 템플릿 </administration-guide/configure/email-templates>` - OKR.BEST의 이메일 템플릿 사용자 "
"지정에 대해 알아봅니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/admin/server-configuration.rst:41
msgid ""
":doc:`Chinese, Japanese, and Korean search </administration-"
"guide/configure/enabling-chinese-japanese-korean-search>` - Learn about "
"enabling Chinese, Japanese, and Korean search for Mattermost."
msgstr ""
":doc:`중국어, 일본어, 한국어 검색 </administration-guide/configure/enabling-chinese-japanese-korean-"
"search>` - OKR.BEST에서 중국어, 일본어, 한국어 검색을 활성화하는 방법을 알아봅니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/admin/server-configuration.rst:42
msgid ""
":doc:`SSL client certificate setup </administration-guide/onboard/ssl-"
